# App (Frontend) npm Scripts & Conventions

- `npm run start`: Start Expo dev server for app development (supports web, iOS, Android).
- `npm run reset-project`: Reset app directory to blank state (custom script).
- `npm run android`/`ios`/`web`: Run app on Android, iOS, or web.
- `npm run lint`: Run Expo/ESLint linting on app code.
- File-based routing with `expo-router` in `app/` directory.
- Edit only the `app/` directory for main app logic and UI.
- Shared components should be placed in `components/`.
- Store static assets in `assets/`.
